<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ SCORES 228 FOR EIGHT IN 50 OVERS VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ SCORES 228 FOR EIGHT IN 50 OVERS VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand, batting first, scored 228 for eight wickets in their 50 overs against England in the fifth and final one-day cricket international at the Basin Reserve on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Score: New Zealand 228 (N. Astle 94, A. Caddick 3-35).</p>
